# Written by the deploy scripts when the tests run them on a local chain: 31337 from Deploy.t.sol,
# 31338 and 31339 from DeployCoinbaseFactory.t.sol, which takes its own ids because forge runs the
# suites in parallel. The record that ships is deployments/10143.json.
# deployments/seed-10143.json is Task 32's tracked seed; its local-chain siblings are not.
deployments/*.json
!deployments/10143.json
!deployments/seed-10143.json
